112
00:15:02,466 --> 00:15:05,904
Maaf, aku perlu tahu tujuanku ke mana.

113
00:15:05,905 --> 00:15:07,080
Oke.

114
00:15:08,124 --> 00:15:10,212
Uh, begini masalahnya.

115
00:15:10,213 --> 00:15:12,823
Aku harus sampai ke Ukiah secepat mungkin.

116
00:15:12,824 --> 00:15:15,391
Penerbanganku ke San Francisco dibatalkan.

117
00:15:15,392 --> 00:15:17,089
