137
00:15:59,567 --> 00:16:01,133
Oke, aku harus sampai ke Chicago.

138
00:16:01,134 --> 00:16:03,700
Aku bisa bayar tunai, aku bisa lakukan apa pun supaya...

139
00:16:03,701 --> 00:16:05,920
