165
00:17:21,257 --> 00:17:24,390
Sistem pelacak kendaraan, komputer dispatch.

166
00:17:24,391 --> 00:17:26,306
Sekarang mereka nggak bisa melihat kita.

167
00:17:33,487 --> 00:17:35,357
Dengar, aku nggak mau melaporkan dia atau apa pun.

168
00:17:35,358 --> 00:17:37,185
Tapi tetap ada aturan, kau tahu?

169
00:17:37,186 --> 00:17:39,013
Kenapa kamu meneleponku?

170
00:17:39,014 --> 00:17:40,275
Aku cuma bilang padanya...

171
00:17:40,276 --> 00:17:42,277
Kamu sudah menyampaikan maksudmu, Grace.

172
00:17:42,278 --> 00:17:45,106
Dia harus hati-hati soal hal seperti ini.

173
00:17:45,107 --> 00:17:46,674
Ya, baik. Oke.

174
00:17:47,979 --> 00:17:49,893
Dengar, aku sedang kerja sekarang.

175
00:17:49,894 --> 00:17:51,373
Aku harus pergi.

176
00:17:51,374 --> 00:17:54,159
Lagi ramai sekali; aku nggak bisa teleponan sekarang.

177
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,595
Tunggu, tunggu.

178
00:17:55,596 --> 00:17:57,118
Kalau ada yang mau kamu katakan ke Hassan,

179
00:17:57,119 --> 00:17:58,641
