234
00:22:53,023 --> 00:22:55,285
Somalia? Serius?

235
00:22:55,286 --> 00:22:57,113
Ya, serius.

236
00:22:57,114 --> 00:22:58,202
Huh.

237
00:23:00,074 --> 00:23:02,989
Lucu juga. Kamu nggak terlalu terlihat seperti orang Somalia.

238
